Description: DBCA build of the CPython 3.15 interpreter
 CPython 3.15 compiled from upstream source for DBCA application
 container images.
 .
 The interpreter is installed under /opt/python/3.15 and exposed using
 version-specific commands. It does not replace the operating system's
 default /usr/bin/python3 interpreter.
